<?xml version='1.0' encoding='utf-8'?>
<catalogue xmlns="http://www.battlescribe.net/schema/catalogueSchema" id="312ba713-8696-59e2-93f0-a6f92cbb763a" name="I Legion Dark Angels - Campaign" revision="1" battleScribeVersion="2.03" gameSystemId="86405571-5289-597b-b308-a9a2d68c00b9" gameSystemRevision="4" library="false">
 <readme>I Legion Dark Angels - Campaign

The campaign version of this Legion's fleet. Every ship carries its own Campaign Record: Veteran Level, Battle Honours (maximum four, +5 pts each) and Battle Scars (no limit, −5 pts each).

Use this catalogue for Great Crusade campaign play. For a normal game use the standard catalogue of the same name instead — the two are separate systems and should not be mixed in one roster.

Full rules: campaign/GREAT-CRUSADE-CAMPAIGN.md</readme><selectionEntries>
 <selectionEntry id="598fb46e-ae3c-56b7-b2da-28480f8e3c25" name="Grand Cruiser" hidden="false" collective="false" import="true" type="unit">
 <constraints><constraint type="max" value="3.0" field="selections" scope="roster" shared="false" id="df262069-9cf1-5ed8-9dde-3203a9e97f70" percentValue="false" includeChildSelections="false" includeChildForces="true" /></constraints><profiles>
 <profile id="57b10daa-e368-5169-ba3a-c133974f1457" name="Grand Cruiser" hidden="false" typeId="806f9ff1-fd51-5ddb-b005-ce73a5d09d65" typeName="Ship">
 <characteristics>
 <characteristic name="BS" typeId="d130e705-611e-5a0a-bd7d-ea8e848fdb2e">3</characteristic>
 <characteristic name="Prow" typeId="84a55377-edbc-5825-a2bf-70c6155018f2">13</characteristic>
 <characteristic name="Side" typeId="5f595433-7397-5c4b-9d4a-8f35d83a2b29">12</characteristic>
 <characteristic name="Stern" typeId="cd9ec76e-f959-5560-8845-9ab242f16e71">11</characteristic>
 <characteristic name="HP" typeId="ef713781-2034-5fb4-83d1-e49d1d683694">9</characteristic>
 <characteristic name="VS" typeId="84309751-688d-50ef-8940-d8d042261a56">6</characteristic>
 <characteristic name="Speed" typeId="25d0e01e-8e74-55b3-8a2a-17773c881625">8″</characteristic>
 <characteristic name="Turn" typeId="899e9c58-70ef-5da5-8495-5bf6a8b7f8f0">45°</characteristic>
 <characteristic name="Crew" typeId="2f6312dd-493e-53c6-96e2-d901afca0e81">7</characteristic>
 </characteristics>
 </profile>
 <profile id="5781e448-473c-5496-b90a-0909054bcf42" name="Hardpoint Construction" hidden="true" typeId="3ec9b61c-f3d1-5fe4-adb4-6104872812e1" typeName="Ability">
 <characteristics>
 <characteristic name="Description" typeId="5e1f6242-764b-516f-9c81-5659b132c092">Bare chassis. Every mounted weapon is purchased separately. No upgrade-spend ceiling. Legal choices are controlled by hull class, hardpoint type and facing; each hardpoint must contain exactly one weapon.</characteristic>
 </characteristics>
 </profile>
 <profile id="433da855-e144-584d-88fa-2a4ebaf3711e" name="Mount Capacity" hidden="true" typeId="3ec9b61c-f3d1-5fe4-adb4-6104872812e1" typeName="Ability"><characteristics><characteristic name="Description" typeId="5e1f6242-764b-516f-9c81-5659b132c092">Port: 3 · Starboard: 3 · Prow Ordnance: 3 · Dorsal: 3 · Defence: 6 · Hangar: 1</characteristic></characteristics></profile><profile id="cb38b74f-b4b9-59b7-8967-81cd8909b910" name="Hardpoint Configuration" hidden="true" typeId="3ec9b61c-f3d1-5fe4-adb4-6104872812e1" typeName="Ability"><characteristics><characteristic name="Description" typeId="5e1f6242-764b-516f-9c81-5659b132c092">Ships begin with no weapons or Defence Batteries selected. Hangar Bay slots represent built-in hull capacity and cost 0 pts. Each physical hardpoint may take at most one legal component. There is no separate upgrade-spend cap; the hull's mount layout is the limit.</characteristic></characteristics></profile><profile id="e498069d-6ad2-52a8-a8a6-9f32a2b3e324" name="Roster Builder Summary" hidden="true" typeId="3ec9b61c-f3d1-5fe4-adb4-6104872812e1" typeName="Ability"><characteristics><characteristic name="Description" typeId="5e1f6242-764b-516f-9c81-5659b132c092">Crew 7 · Port 3 · Starboard 3 · Prow Ordnance 3 · Dorsal 3 · Defence 6 · Hangars 1. Ships start unequipped. Fill only the weapon and Defence hardpoints you want to purchase; each may contain at most one component. Hangar Bay slots cost 0 pts. Aircraft are purchased separately up to Hangar capacity.</characteristic></characteristics></profile></profiles>
 <rules><rule id="edc61142-70b6-5bc2-bf76-1257c6b487fe" name="Gets Hot" hidden="false"><description>After a Lance Turret or Lance Battery resolves its attacks, roll a D6. On a 1 the firing ship loses 1 Hull Point. Each mount rolls separately.</description></rule><rule id="b661e7c3-efd4-5956-a05c-b34255402a3e" name="Capital Ship" hidden="false"><description>Counts as a Capital Ship for every rule that names one, and fills a Capital slot.</description></rule><rule id="cd211db8-68da-5b6b-a116-604c0948dc86" name="Reload (X)" hidden="false"><description>After firing, place X Reload tokens on the mount; flip one at the end of each battle round. The mount cannot fire while it bears a token.</description></rule><rule id="e1ab31b4-9aa0-59d2-a0ff-c5cf404ed6a6" name="Devastating (X)" hidden="false"><description>Each hit costs X Hull Points, or 1 Void Shield Rating against live shields.</description></rule><rule id="3ea475b5-9b3d-5b84-b253-b8b99660eca0" name="Armourbane" hidden="false"><description>Roll 2D6 + Strength to penetrate instead of 1D6, at 6″ or less, against shields or hull alike.</description></rule><rule id="e0a0d049-0b99-5240-bdf4-f7618f5759d6" name="Point-Blank Broadsides" hidden="false"><description>At 6″ or less, Port, Starboard and Dorsal weapons improve AP by one step — or gain Armourbane instead if their printed AP is already 1. Prow weapons get neither.</description></rule><rule id="4f3e4c30-dcef-5b90-9a66-284af6122646" name="Crippled" hidden="false"><description>Below half starting Hull Points: −1 BS and half Speed.</description></rule><rule id="b5b47425-5b34-5e46-8de4-b3618c8079b4" name="Depleted" hidden="false"><description>At half starting Crew or less: −1 BS. Stacks with Crippled.</description></rule><rule id="07723b26-58eb-5a15-8581-09ddbf9e56d0" name="Locked" hidden="false"><description>Joined by a ram. Neither ship may move; the rammer may not fire on its victim, who fires back at −1 BS. Break Away on 5+.</description></rule><rule id="1acfc536-2f4c-5de6-9fa2-767f9bbb41cb" name="Snap Shots" hidden="false"><description>Firing at BS 1 — hits only on a 6.</description></rule><rule id="2b48d276-3eea-5b6e-87e0-758eac1fd9a0" name="Wreck" hidden="false"><description>0 Hull Points without exploding. Becomes impassable, obscuring terrain; never moves and never Evades.</description></rule><rule id="fed9efbb-2a8f-5473-b26d-378429ad292e" name="Held station" hidden="false"><description>Moved 1″ or less under Burn Retros. Broadsides fire at +1 BS; −1 on Evade.</description></rule></rules><categoryLinks>
 <categoryLink id="87d16672-670e-56c1-82d0-e854f21883ac" name="Capital Ship" hidden="false" targetId="bd422ebf-10b3-5085-89cc-263568c40fe0" primary="false" />
