 <selectionEntry id="e9c20dc5-d0fa-586f-a729-d85ca509ba61" name="Battle Barge" hidden="false" collective="false" import="true" type="unit">
 <constraints><constraint type="max" value="3.0" field="selections" scope="roster" shared="false" id="f05a6bde-7027-5a6c-b609-9e5b5b643d1f" percentValue="false" includeChildSelections="false" includeChildForces="true" /></constraints><profiles>
 <profile id="6b5ea49c-7823-5edf-9af0-0c8dd7bc5d5e" name="Battle Barge" hidden="false" typeId="806f9ff1-fd51-5ddb-b005-ce73a5d09d65" typeName="Ship">
 <characteristics>
 <characteristic name="BS" typeId="d130e705-611e-5a0a-bd7d-ea8e848fdb2e">3</characteristic>
 <characteristic name="Prow" typeId="84a55377-edbc-5825-a2bf-70c6155018f2">13</characteristic>
 <characteristic name="Side" typeId="5f595433-7397-5c4b-9d4a-8f35d83a2b29">12</characteristic>
 <characteristic name="Stern" typeId="cd9ec76e-f959-5560-8845-9ab242f16e71">11</characteristic>
 <characteristic name="HP" typeId="ef713781-2034-5fb4-83d1-e49d1d683694">10</characteristic>
 <characteristic name="VS" typeId="84309751-688d-50ef-8940-d8d042261a56">7</characteristic>
 <characteristic name="Speed" typeId="25d0e01e-8e74-55b3-8a2a-17773c881625">9″</characteristic>
 <characteristic name="Turn" typeId="899e9c58-70ef-5da5-8495-5bf6a8b7f8f0">45°</characteristic>
 <characteristic name="Crew" typeId="2f6312dd-493e-53c6-96e2-d901afca0e81">9</characteristic>
 </characteristics>
 </profile>
 <profile id="4c4d1e7d-d6fd-57ee-9ab5-82565727d907" name="Astartes Crew" hidden="false" typeId="3ec9b61c-f3d1-5fe4-adb4-6104872812e1" typeName="Ability">
 <characteristics>
 <characteristic name="Description" typeId="5e1f6242-764b-516f-9c81-5659b132c092">All Crew count as Legiones Astartes (+1), free; may commit up to full current Crew in a Hull Assault, keeping 1 aboard.</characteristic>
 </characteristics>
 </profile>
 <profile id="94e28635-176c-535c-b496-35f364ded7d1" name="Boarding Forces Validation" hidden="true" typeId="3ec9b61c-f3d1-5fe4-adb4-6104872812e1" typeName="Ability">
 <characteristics>
 <characteristic name="Description" typeId="5e1f6242-764b-516f-9c81-5659b132c092">Boarding forces are bought against the ship’s Crew. Terminator/Dreadnought class limits are enforced; remember a Contemptor occupies 2 Crew slots.</characteristic>
 </characteristics>
 </profile>
 <profile id="bb869b36-0e7e-59ac-a42e-f57386d3fbc4" name="Hardpoint Construction" hidden="true" typeId="3ec9b61c-f3d1-5fe4-adb4-6104872812e1" typeName="Ability">
 <characteristics>
 <characteristic name="Description" typeId="5e1f6242-764b-516f-9c81-5659b132c092">Bare chassis. Every mounted weapon is purchased separately. No upgrade-spend ceiling. Legal choices are controlled by hull class, hardpoint type and facing; each hardpoint must contain exactly one weapon.</characteristic>
 </characteristics>
 </profile>
 <profile id="6bff1fd8-c879-5bb8-b3fd-1b998ba8b549" name="Mount Capacity" hidden="true" typeId="3ec9b61c-f3d1-5fe4-adb4-6104872812e1" typeName="Ability"><characteristics><characteristic name="Description" typeId="5e1f6242-764b-516f-9c81-5659b132c092">Port: 3 · Starboard: 3 · Prow Weapon: 1 · Prow Assault: 4 · Defence: 6 · Hangar: 2</characteristic></characteristics></profile><profile id="fdef659d-b3ec-5c54-b275-445b069b5d2d" name="Hardpoint Configuration" hidden="true" typeId="3ec9b61c-f3d1-5fe4-adb4-6104872812e1" typeName="Ability"><characteristics><characteristic name="Description" typeId="5e1f6242-764b-516f-9c81-5659b132c092">Ships begin with no weapons or Defence Batteries selected. Hangar Bay slots represent built-in hull capacity and cost 0 pts. Each physical hardpoint may take at most one legal component. There is no separate upgrade-spend cap; the hull's mount layout is the limit.</characteristic></characteristics></profile><profile id="3306d240-c296-51d8-816c-409e9d5d2684" name="Roster Builder Summary" hidden="true" typeId="3ec9b61c-f3d1-5fe4-adb4-6104872812e1" typeName="Ability"><characteristics><characteristic name="Description" typeId="5e1f6242-764b-516f-9c81-5659b132c092">Crew 9 · Port 3 · Starboard 3 · Prow 1 · Prow Assault 4 · Defence 6 · Hangars 2. Ships start unequipped. Fill only the weapon and Defence hardpoints you want to purchase; each may contain at most one component. Hangar Bay slots cost 0 pts. Aircraft are purchased separately up to Hangar capacity.</characteristic></characteristics></profile></profiles>
 <rules><rule id="6f78b4da-0729-551b-8148-e54b33713c83" name="Gets Hot" hidden="false"><description>After a Lance Turret or Lance Battery resolves its attacks, roll a D6. On a 1 the firing ship loses 1 Hull Point. Each mount rolls separately.</description></rule><rule id="e6265621-aff7-535a-80a7-b921729c1bec" name="Capital Ship" hidden="false"><description>Counts as a Capital Ship for every rule that names one, and fills a Capital slot.</description></rule><rule id="b98cd34d-bc1c-5729-9175-84fa0ea87551" name="Reload (X)" hidden="false"><description>After firing, place X Reload tokens on the mount; flip one at the end of each battle round. The mount cannot fire while it bears a token.</description></rule><rule id="4b677e28-318e-5b1b-902e-9dc1f554eea1" name="Devastating (X)" hidden="false"><description>Each hit costs X Hull Points, or 1 Void Shield Rating against live shields.</description></rule><rule id="364dfa0d-5019-596c-bc0a-e678936db611" name="Armourbane" hidden="false"><description>Roll 2D6 + Strength to penetrate instead of 1D6, at 6″ or less, against shields or hull alike.</description></rule><rule id="2a2f9271-5479-5ea3-a72e-e648d332d7f5" name="Point-Blank Broadsides" hidden="false"><description>At 6″ or less, Port, Starboard and Dorsal weapons improve AP by one step — or gain Armourbane instead if their printed AP is already 1. Prow weapons get neither.</description></rule><rule id="9f5d57d8-85ce-52ab-b0d3-8f2cff3647a0" name="Crippled" hidden="false"><description>Below half starting Hull Points: −1 BS and half Speed.</description></rule><rule id="af7181bc-beba-5f41-a262-2a64891c6994" name="Depleted" hidden="false"><description>At half starting Crew or less: −1 BS. Stacks with Crippled.</description></rule><rule id="7b9d6c6e-f857-53ec-820d-40280b7527e7" name="Locked" hidden="false"><description>Joined by a ram. Neither ship may move; the rammer may not fire on its victim, who fires back at −1 BS. Break Away on 5+.</description></rule><rule id="5ea32a39-bc5a-56c1-b80e-3f4b0a964bcd" name="Snap Shots" hidden="false"><description>Firing at BS 1 — hits only on a 6.</description></rule><rule id="fa41cbfc-6b48-526a-bb6f-366bd2a6dbdb" name="Wreck" hidden="false"><description>0 Hull Points without exploding. Becomes impassable, obscuring terrain; never moves and never Evades.</description></rule><rule id="0120d907-503e-5c3e-971a-14002f47bece" name="Held station" hidden="false"><description>Moved 1″ or less under Burn Retros. Broadsides fire at +1 BS; −1 on Evade.</description></rule></rules><categoryLinks>
 <categoryLink id="fee282d9-e50c-5a51-a00f-bb6c04253823" name="Capital Ship" hidden="false" targetId="bd422ebf-10b3-5085-89cc-263568c40fe0" primary="false" />
