 <characteristic name="Shots" typeId="f85124c6-e75b-574a-befd-08cd1968bedf">1 each</characteristic>
 <characteristic name="Range" typeId="f06bbe8e-b4ee-55fe-a54c-c6fda727a7fd">60″</characteristic>
 <characteristic name="Special" typeId="59853d0d-663c-56dc-9957-cd236b62b380">One Shot, Devastating (3), Volatile</characteristic>
 </characteristics>
 </profile>
 <profile id="54940cd3-fad5-5bcb-b2f2-d39a5839ad23" name="Defence Battery ×10" hidden="false" typeId="9e230bf6-0ca5-5105-b10d-a29e26b36da4" typeName="Weapon">
 <characteristics>
 <characteristic name="Mount" typeId="a7d4d3c1-fadb-52b5-b9c2-4ca7010a2a7f">All-round</characteristic>
 <characteristic name="Str" typeId="909e3bc8-34f7-50eb-8079-4e717af82c39">6</characteristic>
 <characteristic name="AP" typeId="1086c466-d9ef-5b28-afb0-8d806ff0f9c2">5</characteristic>
 <characteristic name="Shots" typeId="f85124c6-e75b-574a-befd-08cd1968bedf">3</characteristic>
 <characteristic name="Range" typeId="f06bbe8e-b4ee-55fe-a54c-c6fda727a7fd">12″</characteristic>
 <characteristic name="Special" typeId="59853d0d-663c-56dc-9957-cd236b62b380">Aircraft to 12″; ships within 6″</characteristic>
 </characteristics>
 </profile>
 <profile id="dea0e608-1b14-550a-a0cd-8a4eb369163b" name="Gloriana Common Rules" hidden="false" typeId="3ec9b61c-f3d1-5fe4-adb4-6104872812e1" typeName="Ability">
 <characteristics>
 <characteristic name="Description" typeId="5e1f6242-764b-516f-9c81-5659b132c092">A Primarch’s Flagship: never suffers the Crippled −1 BS penalty; must be the Flagship; one per battle; games of 2,000+ points. Gloriana Reactors: once per battle, when VS would reach 0 it remains at 1. Dorsal Lance Batteries fire into all arcs and never Gets Hot. Heavy Macrobatteries use Reload (1). Armament fixed: no Section 11b refits.</characteristic>
 </characteristics>
 </profile>
 <profile id="cb1ad04e-37cc-5756-90da-b398dc9277ae" name="Secrets of the First" hidden="false" typeId="3ec9b61c-f3d1-5fe4-adb4-6104872812e1" typeName="Ability">
 <characteristics>
 <characteristic name="Description" typeId="5e1f6242-764b-516f-9c81-5659b132c092">In each Command Phase choose one weapon system aboard; until end of turn it gains +1 Strength, +12″ Range, or Armourbane. Hangar Bays (4).</characteristic>
 </characteristics>
 </profile>
 <profile id="ff0a0863-12ff-55ec-8142-75380d3540f6" name="Boarding Forces Validation" hidden="true" typeId="3ec9b61c-f3d1-5fe4-adb4-6104872812e1" typeName="Ability">
 <characteristics>
 <characteristic name="Description" typeId="5e1f6242-764b-516f-9c81-5659b132c092">Boarding forces are bought against the ship’s Crew. Terminator/Dreadnought class limits are enforced; remember a Contemptor occupies 2 Crew slots.</characteristic>
 </characteristics>
 </profile>
 <profile id="df637c90-5288-520c-8c18-50ee3c59297b" name="Mount Capacity" hidden="true" typeId="3ec9b61c-f3d1-5fe4-adb4-6104872812e1" typeName="Ability">
 <characteristics>
 <characteristic name="Description" typeId="5e1f6242-764b-516f-9c81-5659b132c092">Port: 4 | Starboard: 4 | Prow: 7 | Dorsal: 8 | All-round: 10 | Hangar Bays: 4. Mounts, not arbitrary refit counts, are the limiting factor for weapon configuration.</characteristic>
 </characteristics>
 </profile>
 <profile id="9eb15259-c666-5b9f-882c-2fc65b1501a1" name="Commander Embarkation" hidden="true" typeId="3ec9b61c-f3d1-5fe4-adb4-6104872812e1" typeName="Ability"><characteristics><characteristic name="Description" typeId="5e1f6242-764b-516f-9c81-5659b132c092">Choose exactly one Fleet Commander. This character is embarked aboard this Flagship.</characteristic></characteristics></profile><profile id="69e81355-7dbf-5b1e-bac0-b065a4a72a7a" name="Retinue Eligibility" hidden="true" typeId="3ec9b61c-f3d1-5fe4-adb4-6104872812e1" typeName="Ability"><characteristics><characteristic name="Description" typeId="5e1f6242-764b-516f-9c81-5659b132c092">The Primarch Retinue slot may only be used when the Primarch is selected as this ship's Fleet Commander. Choose at most one named Character of the same Legion.</characteristic></characteristics></profile><profile id="312a48af-dd58-5b75-b88e-4769f94c9b9e" name="Roster Builder Summary" hidden="true" typeId="3ec9b61c-f3d1-5fe4-adb4-6104872812e1" typeName="Ability"><characteristics><characteristic name="Description" typeId="5e1f6242-764b-516f-9c81-5659b132c092">Crew 10. Ships start unequipped. Fill only the weapon and Defence hardpoints you want to purchase; each may contain at most one component. Hangar Bay slots cost 0 pts. Aircraft are purchased separately up to Hangar capacity.</characteristic></characteristics></profile></profiles>
